{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13109120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13109120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310912001:1":{"text":"ああ、やっとついた……デューラ様に感謝。どうです？厳かで敬虔な雰囲気に圧倒されるでしょう？","source_cn":"啊，总算到了，白山修道院……艾雅在上，任何人都会被这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9380C6CFD547950D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310912002:1":{"text":"すごく静かですね。門番もいないし、人の声が全然聞こえません！","source_cn":"这里好安静啊，没有守门人，连说话的声音都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05BD42F220D9E46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310912003:1":{"text":"心を静める神聖な場所ですからね。ご覧ください、この国の守護聖人であり、修道院の初代院長、セントヤンコヴィッチ様の彫像です。","source_cn":"因为这是静心沉思的神圣场所。看，这是圣杨凯维奇的雕像，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA830905D3508F86E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310912004:1":{"text":"彼のような敬虔で人徳の高い人になれるよう、私の両親が同じ名前をつけてくれたんです。","source_cn":"我的父母为我起了和他一样的名字，正是希望我也能成为和他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F01537BCA0E576D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310912005:1":{"text":"万が一に備えて、周囲を確認した方がいいわ。","source_cn":"为了防备意外，我们应该先四处看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2FE248BA444C3BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docume